<title>UK: CRICKET-PAKISTAN DECLARE FIRST INNINGS AT 521-8.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN DECLARE FIRST INNINGS AT 521-8.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan declared their first</p>
<p>innings at 521-8 on the fourth day of the third and final test</p>
<p>against England at The Oval on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 326; Pakistan 521-8.</p>
</text>
